OL,3,GNEWSALatest stage of #11m ring main
OL,4,Aproject to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Water is set to begin the next
OL,7,Fphase of its #11m ring main project, a
OL,8,Fmajor upgrade designed to secure water
OL,9,Fsupplies to the north of the island for
OL,10,Fdecades to come.
OL,12,FWork was due to start on 1 September
OL,13,Fand continue until 21 December along
OL,14,FRoute de la Hougue du Pommier and Route
OL,15,Fde la Charruee, where about 2,788ft
OL,16,F(850m) of new main would be installed
OL,17,Fin the utility's largest capital
OL,18,Fproject of 2026, project leaders said.
OL,20,FThe scheme forms part of a wider
OL,21,Fprogramme expected to take until about
OL,22,F2032 to complete.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
