OL,3,GNEWSALatest stage of #11m ring main
OL,4,Aproject to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Water previously described the
OL,7,Fring main as "the motorway of the water
OL,8,Fnetwork", carrying water around the
OL,9,Fisland while maintaining pressure for
OL,10,Fhomes and businesses.
